# The CC0 enemy pack is downloaded, not committed — see public/models/README.md. It is public
# domain, so this is about weight and provenance rather than licensing: a few megabytes of
# binary that nobody in this repository authored, which anyone can fetch again in a minute.
public/models/*.glb
public/models/*.gltf
public/models/*.bin

# The wall texture is downloaded, not committed — see public/textures/README.md. Same reasoning
# as the enemy pack: CC0, so this is about weight and provenance, not licensing.
public/textures/*.jpg
public/textures/*.png
